   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build Bright Colombian Futures through STEM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Did you know that out of 10 students in Colombia, 4 graduate high school and only 2 access higher education?   You can be part of the solution! MAKAIA&apos;s STEM programs ignite passion for technology, equipping vulnerable youth with STEM skills, IT concepts, robotics, and life skills.    Unlock the potential of 100 students through our project-based methodologies Innovation Labs and STEM Talents Incubator. Let&apos;s foster innovation and break down barriers for professional training opportunities</narrative>
  </description>
